{
  "_comment": [
    "Project-scoped MCP config for Claude Code. Copy this file to '.mcp.json' in",
    "the folder you open Claude Code in, delete the servers you do not use, and",
    "replace every C:\\path\\to\\... with a real absolute path.",
    "",
    "  - CONFIGURATION IS ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES ONLY. No server takes a folder",
    "    flag any more, and this file passes none. Set these FOUR variables once",
    "    for your Windows account and every server below is configured:",
    "",
    "      setx EVA_PYTHON        \"C:\\Python311\\python.exe\"",
    "      setx EVA_DOCUMENTS_DIR \"C:\\Eva\\documents\"",
    "      setx EVA_TEMPLATES_DIR \"C:\\Eva\\templates\"",
    "      setx EVA_KNOWLEDGE_DIR \"C:\\Eva\\knowledge\"",
    "",
    "    ('setx' does not affect processes that are already running - quit and",
    "    reopen your editor afterwards.)",
    "  - Each server works in its OWN sub-folder of those roots, named after the",
    "    plugin: word -> documents\\word, templates\\word, knowledge\\word;",
    "    powerpoint -> ...\\powerpoint; excel -> documents\\excel; pdf-to-md ->",
    "    documents\\pdf + knowledge\\pdf; outlook -> knowledge\\email;",
    "    confluence -> knowledge\\confluence. EVERY ONE OF THOSE FOLDERS MUST",
    "    EXIST. Copy the repo's 'eva' folder to C:\\Eva and they all do; see",
    "    eva\\README.md.",
    "  - knowledge-base is the exception, and necessarily so: it indexes the",
    "    WHOLE C:\\Eva\\knowledge root, which is why every other server writes",
    "    into a sub-folder of it. Its vector store sits outside the corpus, in",
    "    KB_INDEX_DIR (default C:\\Eva\\index).",
    "  - 'command' is ${EVA_PYTHON}, so every server runs under the SAME",
    "    interpreter you installed the pip dependencies into. If you would",
    "    rather hard-code it here, replace it with the full path to python.exe.",
    "  - Backslashes are DOUBLED because this is JSON.",
    "  - PYTHONUTF8=1 stops Windows' legacy codepage corrupting the stdio",
    "    JSON-RPC stream on non-ASCII content. Keep it.",
    "  - Secrets go in 'env', never in 'args': command lines are visible to",
    "    other local users in process listings. Better still, set them as user",
    "    environment variables (setx) and leave them out of this file.",
    "  - To override ONE folder on an endpoint whose layout differs, set that",
    "    server's own variable - MSWORD_KB_DIR, OUTLOOK_KB_DIR, EXCEL_DOCS_DIR",
    "    and so on. An optional one also takes 'off' to switch the feature off",
    "    entirely, e.g. OUTLOOK_KB_DIR=off to keep no local copy of any email.",
    "  - 'word' and 'powerpoint' each get their OWN templates folder,",
    "    C:\\Eva\\templates\\word and C:\\Eva\\templates\\powerpoint. Both are",
    "    read-only: every save into one is refused, so the blanks stay blank.",
    "  - 'confluence' is shown with TWO instances. One is enough: delete the",
    "    CONFLUENCE_NAME* and *_2 settings and it behaves as it always has.",
    "    Keep them and a prompt can say '...on Blue' to reach the second",
    "    instance; anything that does not name a server uses the first. Each",
    "    instance needs its own token.",
    "  - Run each server's --check before wiring it in, e.g.",
    "      & $env:EVA_PYTHON C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\word\\word.py --check",
    "",
    "The recommended install is the Claude Code plugin route instead - see the",
    "root README.md. This file is the manual, project-scoped alternative.",
    "This _comment key is ignored by Claude Code."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "word": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\word\\word.py"],
      "env": { "PYTHONUTF8": "1", "MSWORD_AUTHOR": "Matt" }
    },
    "powerpoint": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\powerpoint\\powerpoint.py"],
      "env": { "PYTHONUTF8": "1" }
    },
    "excel": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\excel\\excel.py"],
      "env": { "PYTHONUTF8": "1" }
    },
    "outlook": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\outlook\\outlook.py"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONUTF8": "1",
        "OUTLOOK_SEARCH_FOLDERS": "Inbox,Sent Items,Archive"
      }
    },
    "confluence": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\confluence\\confluence.py"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONUTF8": "1",
        "CONFLUENCE_MAX_BODY": "20000",
        "CONFLUENCE_NAME": "Green",
        "CONFLUENCE_BASE_URL": "https://green.confluence.internal.example.com",
        "CONFLUENCE_TOKEN": "token-for-the-first-server",
        "CONFLUENCE_NAME_2": "Blue",
        "CONFLUENCE_BASE_URL_2": "https://blue.confluence.internal.example.com",
        "CONFLUENCE_TOKEN_2": "token-for-the-second-server"
      }
    },
    "jira": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\jira\\jira.py"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONUTF8": "1",
        "JIRA_BASE_URL": "https://jira.internal.example.com",
        "JIRA_TOKEN": "your-personal-access-token",
        "JIRA_PROJECTS": "ABC,DEF"
      }
    },
    "knowledge-base": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\knowledge-base\\knowledge-base.py"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONUTF8": "1",
        "KB_INDEX_DIR": "C:\\Eva\\index",
        "KB_EMBED_URL": "https://ai-gateway.internal.example.com/v1/embeddings",
        "KB_EMBED_MODEL": "text-embedding-3-small",
        "KB_EMBED_API_KEY": "your-api-key"
      }
    },
    "pdf2md": {
      "command": "${EVA_PYTHON}",
      "args": ["C:\\path\\to\\claude-skills\\plugins\\pdf-to-md\\pdf-to-md.py"],
      "env": { "PYTHONUTF8": "1" }
    }
  }
}
